<title>FINLAND: Foreign ownership of Finnish shares steady in Aug.</title>
<headline>Foreign ownership of Finnish shares steady in Aug.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreign ownership of Finnish companies registered in the Central Share Register (OKR) stood at 26.3 percent of shares in issue at end-August, down only slightly from 26.7 percent July, OKR said in its monthly review.</p>
<p>Foreign ownership in telecoms group Nokia rose fractionally to 70.03 percent from 69.97 percent.</p>
<p>Foreign holdings in Amer jumped over 11 percent to 53.19 percent from 41.97 percent.</p>
<p>Foreign ownership in Raision Tehtaat was almost unchanged at 48.71 percent compared to 48.85 percent a month earlier.</p>
